<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady with Wednesday's close. Top $50.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3  230-260 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  260-270 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
<p>	  270-280 lbs    47.00-48.00</p>
<p>Sows steady to lower. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>	 over 500 lbs    49.00-51.00</p>
</text>
